      "type": "html",
      "html": "<!-- module: raci-matrix (hand-pasted, filled) -->\n<figure class=\"rci card-outlined\" aria-label=\"主要タスクの責任分担（RACI）\">\n  <figcaption class=\"rci-title\">主要タスクの責任分担（RACI）</figcaption>\n  <div class=\"rci-scroll\">\n    <table class=\"rci-table\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr>\n          <th class=\"rci-corner\" scope=\"col\">タスク ＼ 役割</th> <!-- e.g. タスク \\ 役割 -->\n          <!-- ↓ one th per role -->\n          <th scope=\"col\">PMO</th> <!-- e.g. PM -->\n          <th scope=\"col\">業務部門</th> <!-- e.g. デザイナー -->\n          <th scope=\"col\">開発リード</th> <!-- e.g. エンジニア -->\n          <th scope=\"col\">QA</th> <!-- e.g. QA -->\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <!-- ↓ one tr per task; exactly one .rci-a per row, blank cells allowed -->\n        <tr>\n          <th class=\"rci-task\" scope=\"row\">要件・スコープ確定</th> <!-- e.g. 要件定義 -->\n          <td class=\"rci-cell\"><span class=\"rci-badge rci-a\">A</span></td>\n          <td class=\"rci-cell\"><span class=\"rci-badge rci-c\">C</span></td>\n          <td class=\"rci-cell\"><span class=\"rci-badge rci-r\">R</span></td>\n          <td class=\"rci-cell\"><span class=\"rci-badge rci-i\">I</span></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <th class=\"rci-task\" scope=\"row\">データ移行 設計・実行</th> <!-- e.g. UI設計 -->\n          <td class=\"rci-cell\"><span class=\"rci-badge rci-c\">C</span></td>\n          <td class=\"rci-cell\"><span class=\"rci-badge rci-a\">A</span></td>\n          <td class=\"rci-cell\"><span class=\"rci-badge rci-r\">R</span></td>\n          <td class=\"rci-cell\"></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <th class=\"rci-task\" scope=\"row\">本番リリース判定</th> <!-- e.g. 実装 -->\n          <td class=\"rci-cell\"><span class=\"rci-badge rci-i\">I</span></td>\n          <td class=\"rci-cell\"><span class=\"rci-badge rci-c\">C</span></td>\n          <td class=\"rci-cell\"><span class=\"rci-badge rci-a\">A</span></td>\n          <td class=\"rci-cell\"><span class=\"rci-badge rci-r\">R</span></td>\n        </tr>\n        <!-- ↑ repeat: one tr per task -->\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n  <!-- ── LEGEND (R / A / C / I meanings) ─────────────────────────────────────── -->\n  <div class=\"rci-legend\">\n    <span class=\"rci-key\"><span class=\"rci-badge rci-r\">R</span>実行責任</span> <!-- e.g. 実行担当 -->\n    <span class=\"rci-key\"><span class=\"rci-badge rci-a\">A</span>説明責任（承認者）</span> <!-- e.g. 説明責任 -->\n    <span class=\"rci-key\"><span class=\"rci-badge rci-c\">C</span>相談先</span> <!-- e.g. 相談先 -->\n    <span class=\"rci-key\"><span class=\"rci-badge rci-i\">I</span>情報共有</span> <!-- e.g. 情報共有 -->\n  </div>\n</figure>",
      "cssModules": [
